  m_Name: DOC_1924_SoKhoaHon
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KhoaHon.Notebook.DocumentData
  id: DOC_1924_SoKhoaHon
  title: "The Blackwood Vademecum \u2014 T\u1EADp I"
  titleEn: "The Blackwood Vademecum \u2014 Volume I"
  year: 1
  body: "Alchemical Soul-Lock. L\u1EA5y n\u0103m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\xE2n c\u1EADn
    l\xE0m n\u0103m M\u1EAFt Tr\u1EADn: Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Gi\u1EEF Ch\xECa, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    Th\u1EE3, Qu\xFD B\xE0, \u0110\u1EE9a Tr\u1EBB, K\u1EBB L\u1EEF Kh\xE1ch. L\u1EA5y
    t\xE1m th\u1EE3 x\xE2y ch\xF4n trong v\xE1ch l\xE0m m\u1EA1ch d\u1EABn kh\xED
    u\u1EBF.\n\nM\u01B0\u1EDDi ba linh h\u1ED3n kh\xF3a v\xE0o Kh\u1ED1i C\u1ED5
    V\u1EADt. K\u1EBB gi\u1EEF C\u1ED5 V\u1EADt h\u01B0\u1EDFng ph\xFA qu\xFD v\xE0
    tu\u1ED5i th\u1ECD kh\xF4ng c\xF9ng.\n\nN\u0103m b\u1EC7 n\u1EBFn l\xE0 n\u0103m
    c\u1EEDa c\u1EE7a tr\u1EADn. Th\u1EAFp \u0111\xFAng n\u0103m trang, x\xEDch d\u01B0\u1EDBi
    b\u1EBFp s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1EE9t.\n\n(K\xE8m s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 n\u0103m
    b\u1EC7 n\u1EBFn.)"
  bodyEn: 'The Alchemical Soul-Lock. Take five intimates as the five Eyes of the
    circle: the Keeper, the Builder, the Lady, the Child, the Wayfarer. Wall up eight
    masons to carry the foul air.


    Thirteen souls bound into the Obsidian Relic.
    Whoever holds the Relic shall know wealth and years without end.


    The five
    candle stands are the five gates. Light the five true pages and the chains beneath
    the kitchen will break of themselves.


    (A diagram of five candle stands
    is attached.)'
  serif: 1
  flagOnRead: 0
